##* {{RQ:Addison Cato|scene=i|page=17|passage=Fathers, vve once again are met in Council. / [[w:Julius Caesar|[Julius] ''Cæsar'']]’s Approach has ſummon’d us together, / And ''Rome'' '''attends''' her Fate from our Reſolves: {{...}}}}
##* {{RQ:Smollett Regicide|scene=i|page=17|passage=Here I '''attend''' / The King—and lo! he comes.— {{...}}}}
## {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[expect]] or [[look#Verb|look]] forward to (someone or something).
